title: AWS v2 RDS: Network IO
agents: aws_v2
catalog: cloud/aws
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the network IO of AWS/RDS.

 To make this check work you have to configure the related
 special agent {Amazon Web Services (AWS) v2}.

 No default levels are set, but levels are configurable via the
 rule "AWS v2/RDS network IO".

discovery:
 Each instance is a piggyback host with the name {<instance ID>_<region>}.
 One service is created on this host if all required metrics
 (NetworkReceiveThroughput, NetworkTransmitThroughput) are given.
